  "foaf:name": "Voices of the Ocean Decade: A Tour of the World",
  "sdo:name": "Voices of the Ocean Decade: A Tour of the World",
  "sdo:description": "Developing the science we need to achieve the outcomes of the Ocean Decade is critical, but the human dimension of these outcomes is often overlooked by scientists and policy-makers. This project will collect historical documents of individuals working within the Ocean Decade. The interviews will capture success stories, challenges, and gaps within the Ocean Decade. Providing the platform for a diverse audience to share their stories will allow the listeners to learn about the individuals shaping the science, policy, and decisions of the Ocean Decade. The interviews will be available for students, scholars, and other stakeholders throughout the future.",
